Value MODEL (((?!\sRouter).)+)
Value VERSION (\S+(?:\s+\S+)*)
Value UPTIME (.+)


Start
  ^HUAWEI\s+${MODEL}\s+(Router\s+)?uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}$$ -> Record
  ^Huawei\s+${MODEL}\s+(Router\s+)?uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}$$ -> Record
  ^Quidway\s+${MODEL}\s+(Router\s+)?uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}$$ -> Record
  ^${MODEL}\(Master\).*uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}$$ -> Record
  ^${MODEL}\(\w+\)\s+\d+\s+:\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}$$ -> Record
  ^VRP.*Version\s+${VERSION}
